{
  "id": "p36",
  "title": "The Emergency Drill",
  "titleZh": "应急演练",
  "topic": "城市应急演练",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "A city emergency drill tests the whole busy network today.",
        "zh": "今天一场城市应急演练检验了整个繁忙的网络。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A false signal tests the intelligence of every quick rescue team.",
        "zh": "一个虚假信号检验着每支快速救援队的情报能力。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One terrorist may gamble and seize the main control room tonight.",
        "zh": "一名恐怖分子可能在今晚赌一把，夺取主控制室。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt's aid group shares a simple theory with us.",
        "zh": "我姑姑的援助小组与我们分享了一个简单的理论。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They publish a short report after a long delay.",
        "zh": "他们在长时间延误后发布了一份简短报告。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the division between two teams starts a lively debate.",
        "zh": "然后两队之间的分歧引发了一场热烈的辩论。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An expert gives the leading speech before the noon lunch break.",
        "zh": "一位专家在中午午休前做了开场演讲。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A request for more careful reporting arrives at the front desk.",
        "zh": "一份要求更细致报道的请求送到前台。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A gay couple and their associate join the volunteer team.",
        "zh": "一对同性伴侣和他们的同事加入了志愿者队伍。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A suitable plan rests on one clear and simple assumption.",
        "zh": "一个合适的方案建立在一个清晰简单的假设上。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The first impression hides a deeper inner fear.",
        "zh": "第一印象掩盖了更深层的内心恐惧。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My brother's long string and metal hook hang by the door.",
        "zh": "我哥哥的长绳和金属钩挂在门边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Some neighbours oppose the plan, and a quiet poet agrees at once.",
        "zh": "一些邻居反对这个方案，一位安静的诗人立刻赞同。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A musical group plays for a native speaker from the north.",
        "zh": "一支乐队为一位来自北方的母语者演奏。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A fence keeps the virus test away from the crowd.",
        "zh": "一道围栏把病毒检测挡在人群之外。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later a jet flies worldwide and returns before dark.",
        "zh": "后来一架喷气机飞遍全球，天黑前返回。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mother's bake sale becomes a small but useful factor.",
        "zh": "我母亲的烘焙义卖成了一个微小但有用的因素。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It is okay if the result is possibly a little slow.",
        "zh": "如果结果可能有点慢，也没关系。"
      },
      {
        "en": "New rules impose a calm style of leadership.",
        "zh": "新规则带来一种冷静的领导风格。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The prime choice is a careful selection of local helpers.",
        "zh": "首要选择是仔细挑选本地帮手。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "One small device can capture every word in the room.",
        "zh": "一个小装置能记录房间里的每一句话。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later they pit two teams together, suspend the game, and process results.",
        "zh": "后来他们把两队放在一起，暂停比赛，并处理结果。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The plan will integrate retail news into the report.",
        "zh": "这个计划将把零售新闻整合进报告。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A naval boat makes a gradual turn toward the bay.",
        "zh": "一艘海军船只缓缓转向海湾。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The mortgage and earnings figures shock the small bank.",
        "zh": "房贷和收入数据让这家小银行震惊。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A rape case and a treasury error fill the evening news.",
        "zh": "一起强奸案和一处财政错误占据了晚间新闻。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Helpers deliver the last heavy box of medical substance.",
        "zh": "帮手们送来最后一箱沉重的医疗物质。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An extensive report ends with a touch of rouge.",
        "zh": "一份详尽的报告以一抹胭脂收尾。"
      }
    ]
  ],
